note: The Random library adds random numbers.
add library "Random"

Define secret as random number between 1 and 10.
ask "I am thinking of a number between 1 and 10. Your guess?" and save answer as guess

if 'guess' is equal to 'secret' then
  say "You guessed it!"
otherwise
  say "No luck this time. The number was " plus 'secret' plus "."
end if
